      "message": "`kubernetes/terraform.tfstate` is committed to the repository. A state file records every attribute of every managed resource in plaintext, including the ones providers mark sensitive, so a committed state file is a committed secret store. Remove it from version control, add `*.tfstate` and `*.tfstate.backup` to .gitignore, move the state to a remote backend, and rotate anything it held.",
